keywords:
  - agent-os
  - cognitive-agent
  - context-management
  - runtime-owned-identity
  - provider-architecture
abstract: >
  Julia Core is a modular Agent Operating System with
  Context OS, Memory OS, Persona Engine, and Domain Provider architecture.
  It separates identity ownership from language models,
  enabling persistent cognitive agents that survive model and provider migration.
